# Force LF for all text files regardless of the checkout platform's git
# config. Several tests in this repo read source files with `fs.readFileSync`
# and assert on their exact text (line-anchored regexes, exact-equality
# string diffs) — a Windows checkout with `core.autocrlf=true` silently
# rewrites every line ending to CRLF, and those tests then fail for a reason
# that has nothing to do with the code under test. This makes checkouts
# byte-identical across platforms so `npm test` behaves the same on every
# machine as it does in CI (which runs on ubuntu-latest and was never
# affected).
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets: never touch, never diff as text.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.mp4 binary
